<diagram id="pb-mvp-status-v0124" name="PB MVP Status — v0.1.124"><mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1280" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1280" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="s-title" value="&lt;b&gt;Promptbranch MVP status — control plane proven, application-development loop not yet proven&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="25" width="1700" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s-sub" value="Evidence checkpoint: accepted/current artifact v0.1.124 • runtime v0.1.123.2.6 • local candidate lifecycle complete • Project Source publication not performed" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=14;fontColor=#374151;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="82" width="1620" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="boundary" value="&lt;b&gt;Critical boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are still validating &lt;b&gt;Promptbranch itself&lt;/b&gt;: its CLI, state model, ChatGPT integration, source transactions, test orchestration, artifact intake, and guarded adoption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have &lt;b&gt;not yet proven an external application/tool development lifecycle driven by PB&lt;/b&gt;." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=16;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="135" width="520" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="status" value="&lt;b&gt;Current authoritative state&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Accepted/current artifact: &lt;b&gt;v0.1.124&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installed PB runtime: &lt;b&gt;v0.1.123.2.6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Candidate lifecycle: &lt;b&gt;complete&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full candidate profile: &lt;b&gt;direct transport passed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Project Source uploaded/verified: &lt;b&gt;no&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;All optional transport matrices: &lt;b&gt;not proven&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="135" width="520" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Maturity legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;■ Proven with operator evidence&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a6700&quot;&gt;■ Implemented/partial or policy-dependent&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6b7280&quot;&gt;■ Planned / not yet proven&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Diagram claims are status summaries, not test evidence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="135" width="580" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane1t" value="&lt;b&gt;What has been achieved in the PB environment&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="375" width="1060" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 1. Explicit state scopes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Workspace / task / artifact are independent, persisted, and re-read before authority changes." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="425" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 2. Structured ask/reply contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Promptbranch request/reply JSON is validated; assistant prose and links remain advisory." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="511" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 3. Real ZIP artifact roundtrip&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A rendered downloadable ZIP was materialized, verified, and correlated to the exact request/reply." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="597" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 4. Candidate lifecycle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Download/reuse → ZIP verification → migration → smoke/full candidate test → explicit acceptance → current-state proof." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="683" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 5. Transactional Project Source operations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Backend-first reads and UI writes with processing-stream identity, persistence, and fail-closed checks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="769" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a6" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 6. Release evidence and architecture gates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full direct release profile, Artifact Guardian, PBAI declaration/registry/executable/operational gates, impact-test support." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="855" width="1060" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane2t" value="&lt;b&gt;What remains before PB can be called an application-development MVP&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="375" width="580" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="&lt;b&gt;Environment closure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Define the exact mandatory test matrix; fix profile-sensitive full-test timeout and pending-candidate ZIP preservation/recovery." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="425" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r2" value="&lt;b&gt;Publication proof&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Decide whether MVP requires accepted artifact publication as a verified ChatGPT Project Source, not only local artifact/state adoption." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="511" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r3" value="&lt;b&gt;First external app pilot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Create a separate application repository and use PB to drive its target, architecture, slice plan, edits, tests, candidate, and acceptance." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="597" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r4" value="&lt;b&gt;Controlled actuation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Advance the loop from state-only/planned/read-only execution to bounded file mutation under an execution envelope and rollback gate." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="683" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r5" value="&lt;b&gt;Diagnosis/correction loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Run app tests, classify failure, propose the smallest correction, apply only with authority, retest, and stop on green or blocked." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="769" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r6" value="&lt;b&gt;Deployment boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Explicit application release/deploy authorization; no model-driven deployment or broad shell authority." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="855" width="580" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="roadt" value="&lt;b&gt;Recommended transition path&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontColor=#1f2937;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="975" width="1680" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p1" value="&lt;b&gt;A. Freeze PB environment MVP contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Record mandatory versus optional test profiles and close the two lifecycle defects.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;We are here&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1025" width="390" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p2" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Run first app pilot manually through PB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Separate repo; explicit architecture; one small vertical slice; human-authorized mutation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Next&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1025" width="390" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pe1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1" target="p2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p3" value="&lt;b&gt;C. Automate bounded correction execution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Execution envelope, allowlisted edits/tools, rollback evidence, test-driven correction loop.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;After pilot&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="1025" width="390" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pe2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2" target="p3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p4" value="&lt;b&gt;D. Generalize to reusable PB application workflow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Templates, domain modules, multi-repo/release-set support, explicit deploy gates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Later&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1350" y="1025" width="390" height="165" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pe3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3" target="p4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="footer" value="Architecture rule: PB remains the deterministic authority; ChatGPT reasons and proposes; external application code changes, releases, and deployments advance only through explicit validated transitions." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;fontColor=#374151;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="1210" width="1620" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pb-roadmap-v0125-v0134" name="Release Roadmap — v0.1.125 to v0.1.134"><mxGraphModel dx="2000" dy="1360" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1360" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="t" value="&lt;b&gt;Promptbranch release roadmap — finish the PB environment, then prove application development&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="25" width="1900" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s" value="Current accepted artifact: v0.1.124 • next normal: v0.1.125 • external application track begins read-only at v0.1.129 and mutates first at v0.1.130" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=14;fontColor=#374151;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="82" width="1840" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="current" value="&lt;b&gt;YOU ARE HERE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;v0.1.124 accepted/current&lt;br&gt;PB local candidate lifecycle complete&lt;br&gt;External app lifecycle not proven" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=16;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="145" width="360" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="boundary" value="&lt;b&gt;Architecture boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;System A: Promptbranch environment/control plane&lt;br&gt;System B: external application/tool&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Passing System A tests is never System B evidence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=16;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="145" width="600" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="milestones" value="&lt;b&gt;Milestone targets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CP-PROOF: v0.1.125&lt;br&gt;CP-HARDENED: v0.1.128&lt;br&gt;APP-MVP: v0.1.132&lt;br&gt;DEPLOY-MVP: v0.1.133&lt;br&gt;APP-PLATFORM: v0.1.134" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=16;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="145" width="820" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="laneA" value="&lt;b&gt;System A — Promptbranch environment/control plane&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="350" width="1910" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v125" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.125&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proof cycle 2 + final control-plane verdict&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repeat exact candidate lifecycle from v0.1.124; carry this documentation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="445" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v126" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.126&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Persistent whole-release ETA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Duration history, expected finish, confidence, timeout-risk diagnostics." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="445" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ea1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="v125" target="v126"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v127" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.127&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Portable tool-authoring skill&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deterministic tool contracts and export bundle; no broad authority." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1015" y="445" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ea2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="v126" target="v127"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v128" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.128&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Environment hardening and freeze&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Profile timeouts, candidate recovery, summary consistency, test/publication policy." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490" y="445" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ea3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="v127" target="v128"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="exitA" value="&lt;b&gt;PB ENVIRONMENT EXIT GATE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fresh install completes the mandatory PB lifecycle without manual candidate restoration, timeout discovery, or contradictory summaries." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="680" width="1140" height="115" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gateA" value="CP-HARDENED" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="v128" target="exitA"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="laneB" value="&lt;b&gt;System B — first external application/tool developed using PB&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="840" width="1910" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v129" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.129&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pilot bootstrap (read-only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Separate repo, target, architecture, DoD, app tests, slice plan." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="65" y="935" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v130" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.130&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controlled application change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Exact allowlists, snapshot, rollback, human-authorized first mutation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="935" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="eb1" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="v129" target="v130"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v131" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.131&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Test / diagnose / correct&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Run app tests, classify, smallest correction, bounded retries." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1015" y="935" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="eb2" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="v130" target="v131"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v132" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.132&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Application candidate + acceptance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build and verify app artifact; test and explicitly accept app baseline." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490" y="935" width="430" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="eb3" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="v131" target="v132"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="transition" value="explicit architecture decision" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=3;endArr